{"id":"7f2540086a62d464","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md","title":"数码代入的编码正确性","display":"thm-numeral-adequacy — 数码代入的编码正确性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-numeral-adequacy","aliases":["91-thm-numeral-adequacy"],"display":"thm-numeral-adequacy — 数码代入的编码正确性","depends_on":["[[91-df-numeral]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-TB]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-numeral-adequacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-numeral-adequacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-numeral-adequacy — 数码代入的编码正确性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\)</span> (一个自由变量的算术公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (标准数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的对象语言数码)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x(e,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(e,n)\\)</span> (把数字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的数码代入编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (表示该原始递归句法函数的算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> (基础闭句去引号理论)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n\\left(\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\n\\overline n\n\\right)\n=\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n\\left(\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\n\\overline n\n\\right)\n=\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner}\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\bar n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner}\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\bar n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式是编码等式：代入函数的第二参数是要由数码表示的自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，\n而不是数码项自身的 Gödel 编码；其输出才是实例公式的编码。第二式再把\n所得闭基础句代入 TB 的去引号模式。</p>\n<p>公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\bar n)\">\\(\\varphi(\\bar n)\\)</span> 与数值\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner\\)</span> 属于不同句法类型，不能写成\n“公式当且仅当编码等于编码”。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 作对象语言统一量化需要 UTB\n及数码代入项，而逐个标准实例只需 TB。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_x(e,n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n\\left(\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\n\\overline n\n\\right)\n=\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner},","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner}\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\bar n).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\bar n)\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-